      "content": "it's not just doubt though. it's the reality of it. they see me as this success story and i'm just a lie. i feel like every time i'm around them, i'm just reminding them of everything they lost to get me here. i feel like if i could just... undo the mess i've made, maybe they could just be proud of what they actually achieved instead of being burdened by me.",
